        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Electron Desktop Conversion\n\nSketch of what it takes to ship Twilite as an installable desktop app, starting from a thin Electron shell around the hosted web app and ending with Twilite's own Browser chrome as the real window frame.\n\nStatus: **draft sketch, for review** -- not yet an implementation commitment."
        }
      }
    },
